      "blob_url": "https://github.com/coderedcorp/coderedcms/blob/06006cec23a723bc7d76df75ce2c2d795a447902/docs%2Freleases%2Fv0.22.3.rst",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/coderedcorp/coderedcms/raw/06006cec23a723bc7d76df75ce2c2d795a447902/docs%2Freleases%2Fv0.22.3.rst",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/coderedcorp/coderedcms/contents/docs%2Freleases%2Fv0.22.3.rst?ref=06006cec23a723bc7d76df75ce2c2d795a447902",
      "patch": "@@ -8,3 +8,7 @@ Bug fixes\n * Form submission emails were broken on custom form pages which override\n   ``get_form_fields()`` and do not return fields as classes inheriting\n   ``AbstractFormField`` (Bug was introduced in 0.22.2).\n+\n+* Prevent upward path traversals outside of ``CODERED_PROTECTED_MEDIA_ROOT``\n+  when serving protected media files. This only applies to logged in users,\n+  anonymous users do not have permission to access this URL."
